From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:13:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] winhlp32: bookmark macros, HELP_FINDER and file-system
 callbacks quiet

- SaveMark, GotoMark, DeleteMark, IsMark and IsNotMark keep bookmarks (help file and topic) for the process
  instead of reporting that nothing is marked
- HELP_FINDER opens the contents topic without a FIXME; the WinHelp DLL callbacks (for macro DLLs) trace
  instead of reporting FIXMEs

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

